    "title_en": "Infrared Problem in Quantum Electrodynamics",
    "abstract_en": "It is well known that the inclusive cross section in QED is infrared finite. In the standard diagram techniques this result follows from cancellation of infrared divergences. We suggest a new approach that should lead to IR -safe computational technique for QED with massive fermions.",
